OL,3,GNEWSAEx-football boss who plotted to
OL,4,Arape man's wife admits child abuse
OL,5,Aimage offences
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former chief executive of a
OL,8,Fnon-league football club who plotted to
OL,9,Fdrug and rape a man's wife has pleaded
OL,10,Fguilty to separate child abuse image
OL,11,Foffences.
OL,13,FKarl Lindsay, who stepped down from his
OL,14,Fpost at Taunton Town in Somerset last
OL,15,Fyear, last month admitted charges of
OL,16,Fconspiracy to rape and conspiracy to
OL,17,Fadminister a substance with intent to
OL,18,Fstupefy.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
