OL,3,GNEWSAEx-football boss who plotted to
OL,4,Arape man's wife admits child abuse
OL,5,Aimage offences
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 56-year-old had pleaded guilty
OL,8,Fshortly before he was due to go on
OL,9,Ftrial at Manchester Minshull Street
OL,10,FCrown Court alongside nine other men
OL,11,Fwho deny their alleged roles in the
OL,12,Fabuse of the wife in Stockport.
OL,14,FHe appeared at the same court earlier
OL,15,Fby prison videolink and entered more
OL,16,Fguilty pleas to offences not connected
OL,17,Fwith the ongoing trial.
